# Enforce LF line endings in the repo (prevents CRLF from Windows editors or git config)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — do not normalize
*.png binary
*.pdf binary

# Routine memory: each routine run pushes its own claude/* branch that appends one line to the same daily log.
# Two runs on the same day therefore both add a line at the end of log/YYYY-MM-DD.md. The union merge driver keeps
# both sides instead of reporting a conflict, so .github/workflows/merge-routine-memory.yml can merge every memory
# branch unattended. Only the daily logs get this driver: other memory files are edited in place and must conflict
# normally so the owner sees it.
log/*.md merge=union

